# Both Dockerfiles install deps inside the image (npm ci on node:20-alpine) and
# then COPY the source tree over the result. Without this file that copy also
# brings the host's node_modules, silently replacing the musl-built tree with the
# developer's glibc one. bcrypt's prebuilt binary is the one that breaks loudly:
# it links libc.so.6 + glibc's __snprintf_chk, fails to relocate on musl, and
# segfaults the process on the first bcrypt.compare — so every login killed the
# API container. Never ship the host's node_modules into the image.
**/node_modules

# Build output and caches
**/dist
**/.vite
**/coverage

# Secrets and local state
.env
.env.*
**/*.log

# VCS and editor noise
.git
.gitignore
**/.DS_Store
